OCWORLD 1
NAME SoftBodyTune
GROUND 0.0 0
KILLZ -5000.0
SPAWN -200 0 100 0
# The preset tuning rig (docs/plans/wave10/SOFTBODY_DEPTH.md 6.2; test-content/SoftBodyLab/README.md "Tuning").
# One target per preset at the same size, in a row along Y, 300 cm ahead of the spawn: cloth_light flag, cloth_heavy curtain,
# metal door, glass pane, wood crate. Each uses the Soft/*.ocsoft of SoftBodyLab, so a number changed in Details writes the
# same file both maps read. Meshes/*.ocmesh come from the OBJ import described in README.md.
#
# To hit them: press Play, select the target, turn on Show > Soft Bodies > Tuning, and use the Hit buttons of its Details section
# at 5, 25, 90, 400 and 3000 J (Repair between hits). The Tuning HUD prints the last deposit; keep its numbers with the screenshot.
# A 5 kg crate dropped from 50, 100, 200 and 400 cm carries about 25, 49, 98 and 196 J: use the Crate row to check that real
# impacts agree with the buttons.
#
# Static dressing: the pole and the lintel the two cloths hang from.
PLACE Meshes/Pole.ocmesh 300 -900 -1 0 0 0 1 name FlagPole
# The wind: a directional Soft Field on the flag pole's entity. Box half extents 100 x 800 x 300 cm centred on the pole, so it
# covers the flag and the curtain (the pole is at Y -900, the curtain at -450; the box reaches Y -100). 300 cm/s along +X with
# some turbulence. Turn it off in Details to see the cloth hang.
  COMPONENT SoftField kind=directional shape=box extent=100,800,300 strength=300 dir=1,0,0 turbulence=0.3 targets=cloth
PLACE Meshes/Lintel.ocmesh 300 -450 0 0 0 0 1 name CurtainLintel
# The five targets.
PLACE Meshes/Flag.ocmesh 300 -900 200 0 0 0 1 nocollide name TuneFlag
  COMPONENT Cloth asset=Soft/Flag.ocsoft preset=cloth_light
PLACE Meshes/Curtain.ocmesh 300 -450 10 0 0 0 1 nocollide name TuneCurtain
  COMPONENT Cloth asset=Soft/Curtain.ocsoft preset=cloth_heavy
PLACE Meshes/SteelDoor.ocmesh 300 0 0 0 0 0 1 nocollide name TuneDoor
  COMPONENT Destructible asset=Soft/SteelDoor.ocsoft preset=metal
PLACE Meshes/GlassPane.ocmesh 300 450 0 0 0 0 1 nocollide name TunePane
  COMPONENT Destructible asset=Soft/GlassPane.ocsoft preset=glass
PLACE Meshes/PlankCrate.ocmesh 300 900 0 0 0 0 1 nocollide name TuneCrate
  COMPONENT Destructible asset=Soft/PlankCrate.ocsoft preset=wood
